.DS_Store

# host toolchain build output (Makefile)
# Tool binaries. DERIVED, not listed: every tool is <name>370/<name>370, and a
# list of remembered names forgets the next tool -- idrdump370's binary was
# committed for exactly that reason (cc370#429), and a `make` in a freshly
# extracted tree then answered "up to date" and built nothing, so a gate arm
# measured the committed binary instead of the source.
# Control before adopting this: `git ls-files | grep -E '^[^/]*370/[^/]*370$'`
# matched only the binary, so the pattern ignores no tracked source.
*370/*370
/build/

# stale in-tree build artifacts — the real GCC build is out-of-tree in /build/
/cc370/gcc/*.o
/cc370/libiberty/*.o

# generated man pages (pod2man) -- sources are man/*.pod
/man/*.1
